@startuml
' Figure 2: IntentStrategy — Step-by-step 攔截與恢復（跨兩輪）
!pragma teoz true
title Figure 2: IntentStrategy — Step-by-step 攔截與恢復（跨兩輪）
skinparam backgroundColor #fefefe
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam DefaultFontSize 12
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

actor User

box "dify_host [System]" #LightBlue
    box "plugin_runtime [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant AgentInvoker as "AgentInvoker"
    end box
    box "llm_session [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant LLMSession as "LLMSession"
    end box
end box

box "intent_agent_plugin [System]" #LightBlue
    box "strategy [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant IntentStrategy as "IntentStrategy"
    end box
    box "tool_registry [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant ToolRegistry as "ToolRegistry"
    end box
end box

box "n8n [System]" #LightBlue
    box "webhook [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant N8nWebhook as "N8nWebhook"
    end box
end box

== 第一輪：User 發出修改指令 ==

User -> AgentInvoker: 送出 query\n(例如「開啟 131 區的 IM 優化」)
activate AgentInvoker
AgentInvoker -> IntentStrategy: _invoke(parameters)
activate IntentStrategy

note over IntentStrategy
  **Step 1, 4, 5（略，同圖 1）**
  _parse_history → _load_prompt → _build_user_message
end note

== Step 2. _detect_mode_override ==

alt (i) execution_mode 參數 = step-by-step
    note over IntentStrategy
      直接採用參數
      **effective_mode = step-by-step**
    end note
else (ii) execution_mode = auto 但 query 含關鍵字
    note over IntentStrategy
      命中 MODE_KEYWORDS_STEP
      （「逐步確認 / 一步一步 / 先讓我看 / 我要確認每一步」）
      **effective_mode = step-by-step**（覆寫）
    end note
end

== Step 3. _detect_pending_state ==

note over IntentStrategy
  反向掃 history → **無 <pending_state>**
  pending_was_seen = **false**
end note

== Step 6. Agent Loop（第一圈 → 攔截） ==

IntentStrategy -> LLMSession: invoke(messages, tool_schemas, stream=True)
activate LLMSession
LLMSession --> IntentStrategy: response_text + tool_calls\n[ enable_im(location="131") ]
deactivate LLMSession

note over IntentStrategy
  **攔截判斷**
  risky_calls = tool_calls ∩ RISKY_TOOLS = [enable_im]
  should_intercept =
    (effective_mode == "step-by-step") ∧
    bool(risky_calls) ∧
    (pending_was_seen == false)
  = **true** → 執行攔截（直接 return，不進工具執行）
end note

note over IntentStrategy
  **組 pending_payload（寫入 <pending_state>）**
  欄位：
  - tool_calls: list[ {id: str, name: str, args: dict} ]
  - created_at: float  (time.time())
  序列化為 JSON，包進
  <pending_state>...</pending_state>
  附加在 response_text 末尾
end note

IntentStrategy --> AgentInvoker: yield text_message(\n  response_text + <pending_state>JSON</pending_state>\n)
deactivate IntentStrategy
AgentInvoker --> User: 顯示確認提示\n(含 <pending_state> 隱藏標籤)
deactivate AgentInvoker

== 第二輪：User 回覆確認 ==

User -> AgentInvoker: 送出 query（例如「好，執行」）
activate AgentInvoker
AgentInvoker -> IntentStrategy: _invoke(parameters)
activate IntentStrategy

note over IntentStrategy
  **Step 1, 4, 5（略，同圖 1）**
  _parse_history 這次會把前一輪 assistant 訊息
  （含 <pending_state> 標籤）納入 history
end note

note over IntentStrategy
  **Step 2. _detect_mode_override**
  同前：effective_mode = step-by-step
end note

== Step 3. _detect_pending_state（關鍵差異）==

note over IntentStrategy
  反向掃 history → 最近一則 assistant
  含 <pending_state>...</pending_state>
  PENDING_STATE_PATTERN 命中 → json.loads 成功
  **pending_was_seen = true**
end note

== Step 6. Agent Loop（第二圈 → 執行） ==

IntentStrategy -> LLMSession: invoke(messages, tool_schemas, stream=True)
activate LLMSession
note right of LLMSession
  LLM 看到完整 history：
  - 前輪 user: "開啟 131 區 IM"
  - 前輪 assistant: 含 <pending_state>
  - 本輪 user: "好，執行"
  → LLM **重新**決定 tool_calls
  （<pending_state> 只是 strategy 的旗標，
   實際 tool_calls 每次都由 LLM 重算）
end note
LLMSession --> IntentStrategy: response_text + tool_calls\n[ enable_im(location="131") ]
deactivate LLMSession

note over IntentStrategy
  **攔截判斷**
  should_intercept =
    (effective_mode == "step-by-step") ∧
    bool(risky_calls) ∧
    **(pending_was_seen == false)** ← 此次為 true
  = **false** → 不攔截，進入工具執行
end note

loop 每個 tool_call
    IntentStrategy -> ToolRegistry: build_payload(name, args)
    activate ToolRegistry
    ToolRegistry --> IntentStrategy: payload
    deactivate ToolRegistry

    IntentStrategy -> ToolRegistry: call_n8n_with_retry(name, payload)
    activate ToolRegistry
    ToolRegistry -> N8nWebhook: POST /webhook/{uuid}
    activate N8nWebhook
    N8nWebhook --> ToolRegistry: response
    deactivate N8nWebhook
    ToolRegistry --> IntentStrategy: (text, raw_bytes, meta)
    deactivate ToolRegistry
end

IntentStrategy -> LLMSession: invoke(messages + tool_results)
activate LLMSession
LLMSession --> IntentStrategy: response_text (無 tool_calls → 結束 loop)
deactivate LLMSession

IntentStrategy --> AgentInvoker: yield text_message(response_text)
deactivate IntentStrategy
AgentInvoker --> User: 顯示執行結果
deactivate AgentInvoker

@enduml
